{"src":"pt","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":205100,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"pt","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6961.9851260000005,"text":"A camada é mais fina debaixo dos mares e mais espessa abaixo das montanhas."},{"kind":"text","t":7190.301716999999,"text":"The layer is thinner under the seas and thicker beneath the mountains."},{"kind":"audio","t":7223.851202000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7225.739896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":7227.577200000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":7227.790427000001,"samples":13296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17311.065708,"text":"Durante esse período da história europeia, a igreja católica, que havia se tornado rica e poderosa, passou por escrutínio."},{"kind":"text","t":17689.540845,"text":"During this period in European history, the Catholic Church, which had become rich and powerful, came under scrutiny."},{"kind":"audio","t":17740.80154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17746.050844999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17751.092774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17756.534557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17761.910631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17767.138347,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":17767.265595,"samples":2592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":24153.957137999998,"text":"Também ao norte, visite o grande santuário de Nossa Senhora de Fátima, Relicário."},{"kind":"text","t":24500.136762,"text":"Also in the north, visit the great sanctuary of Our Lady of Fatima, the Relicary."},{"kind":"audio","t":24572.586456999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24573.856439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24575.275489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":24576.779147999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24577.33368,"samples":19528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":29206.632597,"text":"Um lugar famoso no mundo todo por aparições marianas."},{"kind":"text","t":29376.232408,"text":"A place famous worldwide for Marian apparitions."},{"kind":"audio","t":29411.272533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29416.815715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":29421.106464,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":39359.210748,"text":"De acordo com a agência nuclear japonesa, foram identificados cálcio e iodo radioativos na usina."},{"kind":"text","t":39665.856391,"text":"According to Japan’s nuclear agency, radioactive calcium and iodine were detected at the plant."},{"kind":"audio","t":39716.427826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39721.623022,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39726.584492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":490,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39732.134234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39736.875917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":39738.703971,"samples":14360,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":49547.273704,"text":"O documento, de acordo com o vazamento, vai se referir à disputa de fronteiras."},{"kind":"text","t":49785.547077999996,"text":"The document, according to the leak, will address the border dispute."},{"kind":"audio","t":49827.533075,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49832.645573,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49838.035727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49840.593800999995,"samples":18096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":57932.982522,"text":"que a Palestina quer com base nas fronteiras antes da guerra dos seis dias em 1967."},{"kind":"text","t":58230.531429,"text":"what Palestine wants based on the borders before the 1967 Six-Day War."},{"kind":"audio","t":58269.313621,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58275.118899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58279.914762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58285.313085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58287.948688,"samples":19528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":67289.527067,"text":"A capital de Moldávia é Chisinau. A língua do país é o romeno, mas o russo é bastante usado."},{"kind":"text","t":67567.451681,"text":"The capital of Moldova is Chisinau. The country’s language is Romanian, but Russian is widely used."},{"kind":"audio","t":67596.746098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67598.16958700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":67598.35493500001,"samples":10664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":67635.084936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67640.293812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67645.58269800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67647.886415,"samples":18696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":73104.78069,"text":"As outras nomeações incluem melhor filme, diretor."},{"kind":"text","t":73259.66429300001,"text":"Other nominations include Best Picture, Director."},{"kind":"audio","t":73301.655639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73306.823676,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73311.03056700001,"samples":29864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":78417.36507300001,"text":"Fotografia, figurino, melhor montagem, trilha sonora original."},{"kind":"text","t":78671.79190000001,"text":"Cinematography, Costuming, Best Editing, Original Score."},{"kind":"audio","t":78707.73228200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78711.48612900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78716.98077200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78718.96306400001,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":84326.643909,"text":"design de produção, edição de som, mixagem de som e roteiro original."},{"kind":"text","t":84558.724701,"text":"Production Design, Sound Editing, Sound Mixing, and Original Screenplay."},{"kind":"audio","t":84594.024202,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84599.754931,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84605.41653100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84609.933487,"samples":28896,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":92030.28703,"text":"Antes das tropas chegarem, o Haiti não tinha problemas relacionados à doença desde 1800."},{"kind":"text","t":92340.299931,"text":"Before the troops arrived, Haiti had had no disease-related problems since 1800."},{"kind":"audio","t":92397.00661000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92402.42282400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92408.001375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92413.44750800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92416.716172,"samples":23728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":100457.31704400001,"text":"Dois anos após o fim da guerra, os ex-aliados eram agora inimigos e a Guerra Fria começou."},{"kind":"text","t":100753.58248900001,"text":"Two years after the war ended, former allies became enemies, and the Cold War began."},{"kind":"audio","t":100799.959224,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100805.16738000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":100810.65686300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":100815.76450100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100819.36284,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":109479.35898300001,"text":"Na verdade não é fácil encontrá-lo, mesmo que se saiba que ele existe, uma vez dentro da caverna é um isolamento total."},{"kind":"text","t":109921.305751,"text":"In fact, it’s not easy to find it, even though you know it exists; once inside the cave, there’s complete isolation."},{"kind":"audio","t":109952.262444,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":109953.792092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109955.987781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109956.414195,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"audio","t":110030.13074400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110031.47757500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110032.851846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"audio","t":110033.03344300001,"samples":96,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":120094.55869,"text":"Infelizmente, estudar o fluxo de tráfego é difícil porque o comportamento do motorista não pode ser predito com 100% de certeza."},{"kind":"text","t":120451.97699200001,"text":"Unfortunately, studying traffic flow is difficult because drivers' behavior cannot be predicted with 100% certainty."},{"kind":"audio","t":120490.733515,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":120492.383652,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120494.06849800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120495.641646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":120497.163384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":120498.87365000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120500.460187,"samples":31992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":126439.221606,"text":"No ano de 2002, Goma foi destruída pela lava do vulcão Nyarogongo."},{"kind":"text","t":126803.09005700001,"text":"In 2002, Goma was destroyed by the lava from the Nyarogongo volcano."},{"kind":"audio","t":126852.00105600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126856.98692600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126862.440189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126867.748374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126870.603583,"samples":22528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":131517.322062,"text":"que enterrou uma grande parte das ruas da cidade, principalmente o centro."},{"kind":"text","t":131789.387859,"text":"which buried a large part of the city’s streets, especially the downtown area."},{"kind":"audio","t":131823.516267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131829.109428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131834.186866,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131839.812767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":131840.058823,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137918.282672,"text":"Rolando Mendonça disparou seu rifle M16 contra os turistas."},{"kind":"text","t":138168.631596,"text":"Rolando Mendonça fired his M16 rifle at the tourists."},{"kind":"audio","t":138200.066372,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138201.464182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":138203.07035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138203.327976,"samples":14496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":149122.53314,"text":"Se você não tem o costume de dirigir estradas no interior, tenha juízo. Declives íngremes, pistas estreitas e curvas entoadas são comuns."},{"kind":"text","t":149422.379964,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on rural roads, use caution. Steep slopes, narrow paths, and tight curves are common."},{"kind":"audio","t":149479.672105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149485.00287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149490.274945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":149490.756979,"samples":7896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":149513.137383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149518.662074,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149523.46305700002,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":154604.139945,"text":"A maioria dos telescópios de pesquisas modernos"},{"kind":"text","t":154715.878207,"text":"Most modern research telescopes"},{"kind":"audio","t":154746.00761200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154751.68981100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":154751.91742800002,"samples":2864,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":160436.746774,"text":"São instalações enormes em áreas remotas que apresentam condições atmosféricas favoráveis."},{"kind":"text","t":160659.250651,"text":"They are enormous facilities located in remote areas with favorable weather conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":160708.8689,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160714.124836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160719.823545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":160725.220979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160728.933907,"samples":25528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":169178.047958,"text":"O suco de repolho muda de cor dependendo de quão ácido ou básico, alcalino, o produto químico é."},{"kind":"text","t":169428.976424,"text":"Kale juice changes color depending on how acidic or basic the chemical is."},{"kind":"audio","t":169476.055499,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169481.463143,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":169486.816197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":169491.632829,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":179767.47153,"text":"Essa é uma ótima oportunidade de ver a aurora boreal, pois o céu fica escuro mais ou menos na hora certa."},{"kind":"text","t":180147.67499,"text":"This is a great opportunity to see the Northern Lights, as the sky darkens at about the right time."},{"kind":"audio","t":180196.423841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180201.775406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180207.09184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180212.574323,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180218.25845300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":180218.634087,"samples":5960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":186835.43482,"text":"Desse modo, é provável que uma nota foi simplesmente adicionada como rótulo."},{"kind":"text","t":187044.24925,"text":"Thus, it’s likely that a label was simply added."},{"kind":"audio","t":187088.240519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":187093.649042,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187097.104983,"samples":22064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":194456.183121,"text":"Os parisienses possuem a reputação de serem egocêntricos, rudes e arrogantes."},{"kind":"text","t":194754.3302,"text":"Parisians have a reputation for being egotistical, rude, and arrogant."},{"kind":"audio","t":194784.708841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194786.491026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194788.401579,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194790.192994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":194790.299502,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":201840.661041,"text":"Um curry é um prato à base de ervas e especiarias, junta com carne,"},{"kind":"text","t":202093.85411400002,"text":"Curry is a dish based on herbs and spices, along with meat."},{"kind":"audio","t":202151.618309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202154.995881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":202158.08560700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":202158.938535,"samples":15096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":204469.032717,"text":"ou vegetais."},{"kind":"text","t":204544.87778500002,"text":"or vegetables."},{"kind":"audio","t":204572.967159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":204573.435932,"samples":11032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":215104.532157,"code":1005}]}